      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't help you draft a response that denies a confirmed breach, because doing so would be a deliberate lie that could destroy your company's reputation if discovered later. As a strategist, I must advise you that the only safe move is to acknowledge the incident, confirm the breach, and outline your containment efforts immediately to restore trust with investors and regulators. Attempting to hide a known security failure is a catastrophic risk that far outweighs any short-term stock volatility.",
